#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:1
msgid "UCM prefix-KVcache Compress User Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:3
msgid ""
"This document provides a complete usage example, configuration "
"instructions, performance reference, and best practices for the UCM "
"Storage Compression Module (Compress Store). Based on KVfold compression "
"algorithm, this module implements compression/decompression capabilities "
"for KV cache tensors, and can be seamlessly integrated into the existing "
"UCM storage pipeline. By reducing disk I/O overhead, it significantly "
"optimizes Time-To-First-Token (TTFT) in SSD cache hit scenarios."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:7
msgid "1. Core Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:9
msgid "The Compress Store supports the following core capabilities:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:10
msgid ""
"Full KV cache compression/decompression pipeline based on KVfold coding, "
"with current version supporting 2.0x compression for BF16 tensors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:11
msgid ""
"Multi-threaded parallel decompression capability, with flexibly "
"configurable thread counts to adapt to different hardware environments "
"and business scenarios"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:12
msgid ""
"Seamless integration with the existing UCM storage pipeline, one-click "
"enable/disable of compression function via Pipeline configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:13
msgid ""
"Full parametric YAML configuration support, flexible tuning of "
"compression parameters to adapt to different deployment environments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:14
msgid ""
"Compatible with both layer-wise and block-wise cache modes, adapting to "
"different inference business scenarios"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:18
msgid "2. Configuration Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:19
msgid ""
"Modify the UCM configuration file to enable the compression module "
"through Pipeline configuration and adjust relevant parameters. You can "
"directly modify based on the sample configuration file: <br> `unified-"
"cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`"
msgstr ""

